<title>DENMARK: Norway's Statkraft raises four pct bond offer.</title>
<headline>Norway's Statkraft raises four pct bond offer.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway's Statkraft SF on Monday raised an existing 400 million crown, four percent, six year bond offer to 600 million crowns, lead manager Den Danske Bank said in a statement distributed by Copenhagen Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>The bond matures on December 5, 2002 and the issue will be listed on Copenhagen Bourse on December 5 this year, it said.</p>
<p>--Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom +45 33969650</p>
